# knitr chunk cache: a regenerable local build accelerator, not
# reproducible source. Its __packages file records whatever packages
# happened to be attached in the interactive session that built it
# (not just packages the cached chunk actually uses) and knitr's
# cache-restore path unconditionally library()s every name in that
# file, so a stray package there breaks any environment that does
# not have it (this broke Render Reports CI in a sibling repo).
analysis/report/cache/
